  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "两个男人的默契托付  (Mutual Trust Over Bu Xiaogu and Xin Huimei)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On a quiet terrace, Xin Huimei's fan-club president meets Chun Yuqiao in person after looking into his student years abroad, and the two men reach a candid gentleman's understanding. Listen to Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "客气了，无妨。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想我知道你在想什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我为什么要退学，你已经知道了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当然，你想去哪里留学都可以。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不知道我的调查评分怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷跟你在一起，你觉得放心就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的建议，我必须采纳。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "惠美交给我照顾，你放心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "至于小谷的工作培养，就交给我吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们都会把她们照顾好的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "客气了，无妨。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are too polite—think nothing of it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想我知道你在想什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think I know what is on your mind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我为什么要退学，你已经知道了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So you already found out why I left university back then?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当然，你想去哪里留学都可以。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course—you should pursue your studies wherever you wish.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不知道我的调查评分怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wonder what score I earned in your background check?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷跟你在一起，你觉得放心就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As long as you feel reassured about Bu Xiaogu working on my team, that is good.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的建议，我必须采纳。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for your advice to stay patient, I will gladly take it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "惠美交给我照顾，你放心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rest assured with Huimei in my care.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "至于小谷的工作培养，就交给我吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And as for mentoring Xiaogu at Xingtian, leave her to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们都会把她们照顾好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both of us will look after them well.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
